<h3 class="govuk-heading-s">The pre-application process</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">
	Applicants must send a notice of intent to us before submitting a full application. This notice must include:
</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
	<li>applicant contact details</li>
	<li>the site address</li>
	<li>the size of the development</li>
	<li>the expected submission date</li>
	<li>whether the proposal requires Listed Building Consent</li>
	<li>any potential issues with the development</li>
</ul>
